    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3712430/extras/f56c5f70501231ccfa21753d001ffa85.avif?t=1755286095\" width=775 height=176 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3712430/extras/62d477ed4a8d0610fe41ebcfe4d80a5c.avif?t=1755286095\" width=592 height=124 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3712430/extras/822cb7bd95b543e1da4007c03a303909.poster.avif?t=1755286095\" width=572 height=248 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3712430/extras/822cb7bd95b543e1da4007c03a303909.webm?t=1755286095\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3712430/extras/822cb7bd95b543e1da4007c03a303909.mp4?t=1755286095\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Carbrix uses a Very simple building system</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Allowing you to build what you want, Almost how you want.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >With Carbrix you can build, Cars Bikes Planes And whatever comes to mind!!!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >With a simple to access anytime Buildmenu Stop Fix and GO!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >And when you're done, just save it and spawn it again anytime.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3712430/extras/cd079fcd9410daad7110fb5733c3befa.avif?t=1755286095\" width=597 height=125 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3712430/extras/9c6dc7971872ad3f74500a357442cb1f.poster.avif?t=1755286095\" width=522 height=246 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3712430/extras/9c6dc7971872ad3f74500a357442cb1f.webm?t=1755286095\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3712430/extras/9c6dc7971872ad3f74500a357442cb1f.mp4?t=1755286095\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Carbrix has a Super fun SandBox mode</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In SandBox mode, you have access to all the blocks in the game with endless possibilities</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Make whatever you have been thinking, dreaming or wondering about!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Play on flatmap And do mini Quests!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >With SandBox what Can't you do?</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3712430/extras/f56c5f70501231ccfa21753d001ffa85.avif?t=1755286095\" width=775 height=176 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3712430/extras/62d477ed4a8d0610fe41ebcfe4d80a5c.avif?t=1755286095\" width=592 height=124 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3712430/extras/822cb7bd95b543e1da4007c03a303909.poster.avif?t=1755286095\" width=572 height=248 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3712430/extras/822cb7bd95b543e1da4007c03a303909.webm?t=1755286095\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3712430/extras/822cb7bd95b543e1da4007c03a303909.mp4?t=1755286095\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Carbrix uses a Very simple building system</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Allowing you to build what you want, Almost how you want.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >With Carbrix you can build, Cars Bikes Planes And whatever comes to mind!!!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >With a simple to access anytime Buildmenu Stop Fix and GO!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >And when you're done, just save it and spawn it again anytime.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3712430/extras/cd079fcd9410daad7110fb5733c3befa.avif?t=1755286095\" width=597 height=125 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3712430/extras/9c6dc7971872ad3f74500a357442cb1f.poster.avif?t=1755286095\" width=522 height=246 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3712430/extras/9c6dc7971872ad3f74500a357442cb1f.webm?t=1755286095\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3712430/extras/9c6dc7971872ad3f74500a357442cb1f.mp4?t=1755286095\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Carbrix has a Super fun SandBox mode</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In SandBox mode, you have access to all the blocks in the game with endless possibilities</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Make whatever you have been thinking, dreaming or wondering about!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Play on flatmap And do mini Quests!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >With SandBox what Can't you do?</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>",
